Defined in: [nextjs/middleware.ts:115](https://github.com/asmyshlyaev177/test-proxy-recorder/blob/f0ca0e777a5f8e322db516b6817b5f52b2a1da1a/packages/test-proxy-recorder/src/nextjs/middleware.ts#L115)

